      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Boca Tóxica. Croagunk infla suas bolsas de veneno para produzir um som estranho e aproveita a hesitação do adversário para atacá-lo com um golpe venenoso. Ele raramente luta de forma justa, mas faz isso apenas para sobreviver. Também é popular como mascote.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Croagunk pode evoluir para Toxicroak no nível 13 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Astonish, Mud-Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Poison Sting</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Taunt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Pursuit</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Feint Attack, Low Kick</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Revenge, Swagger</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Mud Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Sucker Punch</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Toxic, Venoshock</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Nasty Plot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Belch, Flatter, Poison Jab, Sludge Bomb</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, Aerial Ace, Assurance, Attract, Baton Pass, Bounce, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Bulldoze, Chilling Water, Coaching, Confide, Dark Pulse, Dig, Double Team, Drain Punch, Dual Chop, Earth Power, Earthquake, Embargo, Encore, Endure, Facade, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Foul Play, Frustration, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Knock Off, Lash Out, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Nasty Plot, Payback, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Revenge, Reversal, Rock Slide, Rock Smash, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Scary Face, Screech, Shadow Ball, Shadow Claw, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Snatch, Snore, Spite, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Swagger, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Torment, Toxic, Upper Hand, Vacuum Wave, Venoshock, Work Up, X-Scissor</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Acupressure, Bullet Punch, Counter, Cross Chop, Drain Punch, Dynamic Punch, Fake Out, Feint, Headbutt, Me First, Meditate, Quick Guard, Smelling Salts, Vacuum Wave, Wake-Up Slap</p>",
